From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Kopco <hey@oddcelot.dev>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:15:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bun_sys: add a wasm backend that reports ENOSYS

wasm_impl.rs is a third syscall backend next to posix_impl and windows_impl; every operation returns ENOSYS until it is wired to a host filesystem. wasm_libc.rs supplies the Linux-valued types and constants bun_sys names through libc::.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
